  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maps for good land governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected impact of the project is sustainable land management and improved security of tenure for economic and social development of Ukraine. Expected outcomes are new maps in use for land use management and land planning, surveying of parcel boundaries by GPS technology.</narrative>
  </description>
